### get all contacts
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts

### get one by id
GET http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a97a7a7591c810f241b8dde

### Create contact
POST http://localhost:8080/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "James",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Blue",
    "birthday": "1990-01-01"
}

###

### Update contact (Replace ID with an existing contact ID)
PUT http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a9f1eb814ac543a691f04ec
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstName": "Jane",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
    "favoriteColor": "Green",
    "birthday": "1992-05-15"
}

###

### Delete contact (Replace ID with an existing contact ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/contacts/6a9f1eb814ac543a691f04ec